{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/883923-klaive-dueling-advise","id":883923,"title":"Klaive dueling, advise.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-06T11:28:55-07:00","id":883923,"title":"Klaive dueling, advise.","content":"are the rules on Klaive dueling from the Werewolf players guide, compatible, iwth W20, is &quot;Changing ways&quot; going to update them?<br /> <br /> have a game on rpol and was asked...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-06T13:55:48-07:00","id":884047,"title":"","content":"The rules for klaive dueling are to roll Dex + Melee for attack and defense, or maybe use Manipulation instead for a feint, and they don't really need that much embellishment beyond this point. The secondary abilities were a bit of too much word count for too little mechanical significance, especially since for the multiple actions you'd have to spend for great blow, you could make extra attacks and probably deal more damage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-12T09:34:48-07:00","id":889188,"title":"","content":"When I briefly ran a Werewolf game, I &quot;spiced up&quot; Klaive dueling by basically porting in the actual fight mechanics from the Street Fighter RPG. Many or most of the stats overlapped, and the ones that didn't I just allowed the players to use derivative stats (i.e., we don't have stat X in this game, so based on your Dex, Melee, Athletics, Brawl, etc. you can spend THIS many points on populating the necessary stats). It sounds like a lot of trouble to go through for something that really doesn't come up that often, but the players were a little disappointed that there wasn't more of a &quot;To Do&quot; with the Klaive Dueling system, and it signaled to me that they wanted (a) more crunch, and (b) were prepared to do a little work for it. Also, a system designed to simulate organized bouts between single combatants fits nicely with the concept of an <i>anything </i>&quot;duel&quot;. Ultimately everyone had a good time and ended up feeling like there was more flavor overall to Klaive dueling. Your own mileage may vary of course.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Sig","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2319-captotter","name":"CaptOtter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2319_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"405"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}